  "contracts": [
    "All23 pinned Native bodies contain zero CALL instructions. Current complete C and prior REA/Ghidra evidence reused unchanged; TYPE_IN_CASES expands its complete ordinary C switch.",
    "House expansion retains3 passes,4 directions, native blocking mask and neighbor subtype tests. First matching candidate writes the actual coordinates; failure writes the native no-space byte. Coordinate repair keeps the original fast path and bounded228-wide scans.",
    "Expansion stock gathering keeps12 signedWORD stocks, per-tile donor order, population accumulation and donor population0/state5 writes. Repeated donor IDs are not artificially deduplicated.",
    "Shipwright order/boat/home/state filters, tax rounding, dock registry, formation/subtype queries and native rating updates retain established widths and side-effect order.",
    "4696B0/4A4300/4EADA0/542F40 expose logical AL.15 direct cached Native consumers use AL;4EADA0 NEG AL followed by SBB overwrites full EAX using only the resulting CF. C normalized booleans do not expose upper EAX; unseen indirect coverage remains unresolved.",
    "Sun-temple access keeps signed subtype indexing, actual definition-kind switch, parity case and coordinate deltas. Actual Native lookup data is required; no invented part definitions or providers.",
